---
// Product motif for /platform/deliverability: the sender mailboxes with their
// daily cap, the authentication the hubsell team sets up, the sending window and
// the stop on reply or bounce. Sample names and times; no placement figures,
// because hubsell does not publish one.
import { asLocale } from '../i18n/utils';
const L = asLocale(Astro.currentLocale);
const T = ({
  en: { title: 'Sender mailboxes', live: 'Live', today: 'Sent today', cap: 'of daily cap', auth: 'Authentication', set: 'Set up', window: 'Sending window', stop: 'Flow stops on reply or bounce', foot: 'Sent from your own mailboxes through the Google and Microsoft APIs' },
  de: { title: 'Absender-Postfächer', live: 'Aktiv', today: 'Heute gesendet', cap: 'des Tageslimits', auth: 'Authentifizierung', set: 'Eingerichtet', window: 'Versandzeiten', stop: 'Flow stoppt bei Antwort oder Bounce', foot: 'Gesendet aus den eigenen Postfächern über die APIs von Google und Microsoft' },
  nl: { title: 'Verzendmailboxen', live: 'Actief', today: 'Vandaag verstuurd', cap: 'van de daglimiet', auth: 'Authenticatie', set: 'Ingesteld', window: 'Verzendtijden', stop: 'Flow stopt bij reactie of bounce', foot: 'Verstuurd vanuit uw eigen mailboxen via de API’s van Google en Microsoft' },
} as const)[L] ?? null;
const t = T ?? { title: 'Sender mailboxes', live: 'Live', today: 'Sent today', cap: 'of daily cap', auth: 'Authentication', set: 'Set up', window: 'Sending window', stop: 'Flow stops on reply or bounce', foot: 'Sent from your own mailboxes through the Google and Microsoft APIs' };
const boxes = [['AK', 'anna@yourcompany.com', 72], ['MS', 'max@yourcompany.com', 58], ['LB', 'lea@yourcompany.com', 64]] as const;
---
<div class="dlv">
  <div class="dlv__top">
    <span class="dlv__title">{t.title}</span>
    <span class="dlv__live"><span class="dlv__dot"></span>{t.live}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="dlv__boxes">
    {boxes.map(([ini, mail, pct]) => (
      <div class="dlv__box">
        <span class="dlv__av">{ini}</span>
        <span class="dlv__mail"><b>{mail}</b><span>{t.today}: {pct}% {t.cap}</span></span>
        <span class="dlv__bar"><span style={`width:${pct}%`}></span></span>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <div class="dlv__grid">
    <div class="dlv__cell">
      <span class="dlv__lab">{t.auth}</span>
      <span class="dlv__chips"><i>SPF</i><i>DKIM</i><i>DMARC</i></span>
      <span class="dlv__ok">&#10003; {t.set}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="dlv__cell">
      <span class="dlv__lab">{t.window}</span>
      <span class="dlv__time">09:00 &ndash; 17:00</span>
      <span class="dlv__ok">&#10003; {t.stop}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="dlv__foot">{t.foot}</div>
</div>

<style>
  .dlv{ background:#fff; border:1px solid #D3D8E5; border-radius:16px; padding:22px; width:100%; font-family:var(--font-body); color:#192341; box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(25,35,65,.05) }
  .dlv__top{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center }
  .dlv__title{ font:600 16px/1.2 var(--font-head) }
  .dlv__live{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font:600 11px/1 var(--font-body); color:#23757E; background:#E5F4F4; border-radius:999px; padding:5px 9px }
  .dlv__dot{ width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#289B9B }
  .dlv__boxes{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; margin-top:16px }
  .dlv__box{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:34px 1fr 96px; gap:12px; align-items:center; padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:10px }
  .dlv__av{ width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%; display:grid; place-items:center; background:#EEF0F6; font:600 12px/1 var(--font-body); color:#37415A }
  .dlv__mail{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px; min-width:0 }
  .dlv__mail b{ font:600 13px/1.2 var(--font-body); white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis }
  .dlv__mail span{ font-size:11.5px; color:#555A73 }
  .dlv__bar{ height:6px; border-radius:999px; background:#EEF0F6; overflow:hidden }
  .dlv__bar span{ display:block; height:100%; background:#289B9B; border-radius:999px }
  .dlv__grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; margin-top:12px }
  .dlv__cell{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; padding:12px; border:1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius:10px }
  .dlv__lab{ font:600 10.5px/1 var(--font-body); letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#555A73 }
  .dlv__chips{ display:flex; gap:6px }
  .dlv__chips i{ font-style:normal; font:600 11.5px/1 var(--font-body); padding:5px 8px; border-radius:6px; background:#E5F4F4; color:#23757E }
  .dlv__time{ font:600 15px/1.2 var(--font-head) }
  .dlv__ok{ font-size:11.5px; color:#23757E; font-weight:600 }
  .dlv__foot{ margin-top:14px; font-size:11.5px; color:#555A73; text-align:center }
</style>
